  "data": {
    "ruleType": "core-stratagem",
    "group": "Core",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Use it in any phase, right after a friendly unit or model makes an Advance, Charge, Damage, Hazard, Hit, Save or Wound roll, or rolls for how many attacks a weapon gets. Pick that unit or model and roll again. When several dice were thrown, you choose a single die to reroll; Charge rolls are the exception and get rerolled completely. Like any Stratagem, it can be used only once in a phase.",
